 "content": "I will board the hot air balloon. (Affirmative)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We won't be going on the hot air balloon. (Negative)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Why won't we go on? (Interrogative)"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Quantifiers "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use a quantifier before a noun to indicate the amount or number of an item."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use quantifiers to talk about the quantity or amount of something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Quantifiers can be used with countable and uncountable nouns. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "These are quantifiers you can use with countable nouns:<ul><li>many</li><li> several <li> few/a few of <li> a number of <li>  a large/great number of"}, {"type": "example", "content": "There are <span class=\"strong\">many</span> things to do at the camp. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "There is a <span class=\"strong\">large </span> number of plants there. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I want to take <span class=\"strong\">several</span> photos."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hot air balloon "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large balloon filled with hot air used for carrying people up into the sky "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm looking forward to getting on the hot air balloon."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about things you do when you travel."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to overlook"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have a view of something from above "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The mountain overlooks the whole town."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "acre "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a unit for measuring area, equal to 4047 square metres "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are acres of empty land here. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "plain"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large area of flat dry land "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can see the plains from the top of the mountain."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dune "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a hill made of sand "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: We will visit the dunes on our tour."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "surrounding "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "near or around a specific place "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We want to explore the surrounding areas."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "helicopter tour"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a trip around an area on a helicopter "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Today, we are going on a helicopter tour of Botswana. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nature drive "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a trip in a vehicle around the wild  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I went on a nature drive with the tour guide."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob05aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rock painting "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "artwork created on rock many years ago  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We saw many rock paintings on a tour."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob05aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vantage point "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a good position from which you can see something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: From my vantage point, I could watch the animals."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le08ob05aud10"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine you are planning a trip for your friend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose a place for them to go."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet and research things they can do at this place. Make a list of these things."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use your list and write a paragraph (6-7 sentences) using the Simple Future tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your paragraph. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read it aloud to your friend."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about travel and things to do on a trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the Simple Future tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my paragraph aloud."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le08ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Our Namibian safari will start in Windhoek.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "On Day 1, we will board the hot air balloon. Our first stop will be the Sossusvlei Wilderness Camp. It's at the top of a mountain overlooking several acres of open plains. There will be many things to see including the Sossusvlei Dunes, and a number of desert plants and animals.", "id": 2, "time": "4000", "image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "On Day 3, we'll take a helicopter tour over the dunes and a few surrounding areas.  We'll stop at Swakopmund, tour the town and then head to Damaraland Camp.", "id": 3, "time": "23500", "image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "On Day 4, we will go on a nature drive and a visit to the rock paintings.", "id": 4, "time": "35000", "image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "On Day 5, we'll depart from Damaraland and head to Ongava Lodge, the perfect vantage point overlooking Etosha National Park. You can sit and watch a great number of animals drink from the watering hole.", "id": 5, "time": "40000", "image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "From Ongava, we'll fly back to Windhoek.", "id": 6, "time": "54000", "image": "engenn5le08ob05re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Vocabulary and Grammar"}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about travel and things to do on a trip."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk or report about actions, events or people in the future. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can use words to describe specific quantities. "}